# tests/adapt V-13/F-04: growth 0.1*skin per step; results for neigh_modify every 10 (and check no)
# must equal every 1 (all 2944 contacts from step 8). Vars: ev (every), chk (yes|no).
hard_particles yes
atom_style granular
atom_modify map array
boundary p p f
newton off
communicate single vel yes
units si
region domain block -0.0086 0.0086 -0.0086 0.0086 -0.0086 0.0186 units box
create_box 1 domain
neighbor 0.0001 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every ${ev} check ${chk}
fix m1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 10000000.0
fix m2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.3
fix m3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 1 0.5
fix m4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.3
fix m5 all property/global characteristicVelocity scalar 1.0

pair_style gran model hertz tangential history
pair_coeff * *
timestep 1e-6
create_atoms 1 single -0.0075250000000000004 -0.0075250000000000004 -0.0075250000000000004 units box
create_atoms 1 single -0.0075250000000000004 -0.0075250000000000004 -0.005375 units box
create_atoms 1 single -0.0075250000000000004 -0.0075250000000000004 -0.0032250000000000004 units box
